## 📋 Script Format Contract

The pipeline depends on strict parsing of the script format. Each episode lives in one `剧本.md`, with scene markers in this shape:

```
## EP01-SC001  INT. CAFE - DAY
```

Dialogue:

```
林薇（低声）：你到底有没有看过那份合同？
```

VO:

```
[VO] 旁白：三天前，她还以为一切都在掌控之中。
```

The "INT/EXT · location · time" in the scene marker line is what shot planning uses to identify scenes. One wrong character and an entire scene can be silently dropped.

